  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/B1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Fixture: host-secret-no-network violated only for control (same function); init/go (g_secret) and init2/go2 (g_conf.pass via strncpy) produce no flow; -logging/-host-fs inconclusive with 'non_local_store at main.c:11 ... main.c:8' (c.py:2072-2076 stamp, 61e61b9055). MECHANISM: no run-wide store/load relation for file-scope storage; the only cross-function channel is a call edge and init -> go has none. The torsocks pair in this item and WI-nulam is one flow that needs both. ROOT-CAUSE GROUP: taint walk cannot cross memory it does not own (with WI-nulam, WI-potan). Status unchanged."  # 6505
